NPCS
Formato NPC: #n:ID|Dialogue State - 1 means initial - 0 means no dialogue|Nombre|LocationID|is_follower|Status|gdesc
Status formato: UNKNOWN_STATUS = 0, NEUTRAL = 1, ALLY = 2, ENEMY = 3
Formato STATS: #st:IDEntity|EntityType|VidaMaxima|Vida|DanoBase|Fuerza|Defensa|NivelMagia
Entitytype: UNKNOWN_ENTITY = 0, PLAYER_TYPE = 1, NPC_TYPE = 2
#n:1|1|Old_Merchant|12|0|1|ToT"
#st:1|2|100|100|25|1|1|1
#n:2|1|Divine_Merchant|12|0|1|GOD"
#st:2|2|1000|1000|1000|1000|1000|1000
#n:3|1|Young_Merchant|12|0|1|uWu"
#st:3|2|100|100|25|1|1|1


Formato Object: #o:ID|Nombre|Data|Descripcion|cost|Dependency_id|is_movable|is_consumable|LocationID|InventoryType
Use dependency_id = -1 for no dependency
InventoryType = {UNKNOWN_INVENTORY == 0, PLAYER_INVENTORY == 1, NPC_INVENTORY == 2, SPACE_INVENTORY == 3}

Relevant objects
#o:1|Northern_Half_Medallion|NONE|Collect the other Medallion to open the boss gate|0|-1|1|0|24|3
#o:2|Southern_Half_Medallion|NONE|Collect the other Medallion to open the boss gate|0|-1|1|0|35|3
