Armor of DPS build:
#o:100|Helmet_Of_Void|wearable helmet base_damage:1 strength:1 max_health:10 defense:2|Created to cover the face of the most ominous beings on this world, gives the wearer the eyes of a demon! STATS: +1 strength, +10 max health +2 defense|0|-1|1|0|11|3
