#o:102|Arms_Of_Hell|wearable arms strength:2 max_health:10 defense:2|These arms were forged in this AntHell, by the Grand master blacksmith AntGod, gives the wearer the agility to cut through their enemies! STATS: +2 strength, +10 max health +2 defense|0|-1|1|0|11|3
